Likewise, freshness should be policy-relative, not universally monotone in “age + context-change count.” Freeze event time, observation time, validity interval, revocation state, and context-transfer policy separately. Applicability can then be a pure verdict with structured reasons such as `wrong-scope`, `stale`, `revoked`, or `missing-provenance`.

